# PeriodFlow — Local properties (DO NOT COMMIT)
#
# 1. Copy this file to `local.properties` (already in .gitignore).
# 2. Fill in the values below.
#
# --- Gemini (required for AI features) ---
# Free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
#
# --- On-device Gemma model (optional, enables Bloom's fast voice provider) ---
# Direct download URL to a Gemma-2 2B `.bin` (CPU int4) file the app can fetch
# to `filesDir/gemma-2b-it-cpu-int4.bin`. If empty, the voice companion falls
# back to the deterministic heuristic provider — no ML, still fully functional.
# Get the model at https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/gemma-2 or Hugging Face.
# GEMMA_MODEL_URL=https://example.com/gemma-2b-it-cpu-int4.bin
